p.mod:
After paragraph (e), insert—

								(ea)


in respect of the election of the chairman of a parish meeting or a poll consequent on a parish meeting—


									(i)


section 114A applies as if, in subsection (2)(b), “or of a proxy for an elector” were omitted;



									(ii)


section 115 does not apply;




								(eb)


in respect of a poll consequent on a community meeting, section 114A does not apply;


							.
